  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (x+(1)/(x)) = 5 and x > 1\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(x+(1)/(x)) = 5\n\nSo x² + 1/x² = 25 - 2\n\n⇒ 23\n\nAgain,\n\n x - 1/x = √21\n\n x2 - 1/x2 =5√21\n\n⇒ x⁴ + 1/x⁴ = 529 - 2\n\n⇒ 527\n\nx4 - 1/x4 =115√21\n\nx⁸ - 1/x⁸ =( x4 + 1/x4 ) ×(x4 - 1/x4 )\n\n⇒ 115√21 × 527 \n\n= 60605√21\n\n**∴ The correct option is** 1",
